Rice Flour|rice flour]]\n*1½ [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoons]] [[Cookbook:Arrowroot|arrowroot]] flour \n*2 ripe [[Cookbook:Banana|bananas]], mashed \n*50 g [[Cookbook:Durian|durian]]\n*170 g [[Cookbook:Palm Sugar|palm sugar]], shaved\n*1 [[Cookbook:Egg|egg]]\n*250 [[Cookbook:mL|ml]] [[Cookbook:Coconut Cream|coconut cream]]\n*[[cookbook:vegetable oil|Vegetable oil]]\n*120 ml [[Cookbook:Palm Sugar|palm sugar]] [[Cookbook:Caramel|caramel]]\n*[[Cookbook:Passion Fruit|Passion fruit]] [[Cookbook:Ice Cream|ice cream]]\n\n==Procedure==\n\n# [[cookbook:Mix|Mix]] coconut flesh with the rice flour and arrowroot flour. \n# In a separate bowl, mash the bananas and durian together. Add palm sugar, egg, and coconut cream, and mix thoroughly.\n# Pour banana mixture into a [[cookbook:blender|blender]] and process until the mixture is smooth.\n# Mix coconut mixture and banana purée. Cover this and let it chill in refrigerator for at least 1 hour.\n# Heat a pan to medium hot. Brush the pan surface with oil and spoon on the mixture. [[cookbook:pan frying|Fry]] it until it is light brown color.\n# Serve it hot, with the palm sugar caramel and passion fruit ice cream.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for pancakes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using coconut]]\n[[Category:Recipes using durian]]\n[[Category:Pan fried recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for dessert]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using arrowroot]]\n[[Category:Recipes using banana]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ice cream]]\n[[Category:Recipes using rice flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using vegetable oil]]\n[[Category:Recipes using palm sugar]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Durian Pancake","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"90 g grated fresh coconut flesh","sourceText":"90 g grated fresh coconut flesh","amountText":"90 g grated fresh coconut flesh","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"140 g rice flour","sourceText":"140 g rice flour","amountText":"140 g rice flour","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1½ tablespoons arrowroot flour","sourceText":"1½ tablespoons arrowroot flour","amountText":"1½ tablespoons arrowroot flour","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"2 ripe bananas, mashed","sourceText":"2 ripe bananas, mashed","amountText":"2 ripe bananas, mashed","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"50 g durian","sourceText":"50 g durian","amountText":"50 g durian","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"170 g palm sugar, shaved","sourceText":"170 g palm sugar, shaved","amountText":"170 g palm sugar, shaved","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"1 egg","sourceText":"1 egg","amountText":"1 egg","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"250 ml coconut cream","sourceText":"250 ml coconut cream","amountText":"250 ml coconut cream","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"Vegetable oil","sourceText":"Vegetable oil","amountText":"Vegetable oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-10","name":"120 ml palm sugar caramel","sourceText":"120 ml palm sugar caramel","amountText":"120 ml palm sugar caramel","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-11","name":"Passion fruit ice cream","sourceText":"Passion fruit ice cream","amountText":"Passion fruit ice cream","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null}],"steps":[{"n":1,"text":"Mix coconut flesh with the rice flour and arrowroot flour.","sourceText":"Mix coconut flesh with the rice flour and arrowroot flour.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":2,"text":"In a separate bowl, mash the bananas and durian together. Add palm sugar, egg, and coconut cream, and mix thoroughly.","sourceText":"In a separate bowl, mash the ba